("joan-of-arc-victorious-over-the-english-enters-orleans",6,0,"On May 8, 1429 Joan of Arc rides into Orléans as a hero after the English siege is broken, and the crowd cheers her. Jean-Jacques Scherrer painted the triumph in 1887."),
("joan-of-arc",9,0,"Eugène Thirion shows Joan of Arc, in a simple red dress, listening to the angels and saints whose voices, she said, told her to save France. He painted it in 1876."),
